sudoku_hparam_sweep_*/
sudoku_transition/
_sudoku2_smoke/
# Throwaway CPU runs that check a new training flag end to end before a real
# job is submitted (lr schedules, warmup); they write real checkpoints.
_smoke_lr_schedule/
_smoke_warmup_*/
sudoku_attention_distance/
sudoku_attention_evolution/

# Model weights never belong in git (project convention: checkpoints live on
# $SCRATCH and are copied to $OAK by hand when worth keeping). 27 model.pt files
# totalling 267MB were already committed before these patterns existed -- see
# STATUS "Open problems"; they are left tracked rather than untracked here,
# because untracking does not shrink the history and this is the user's call.
*.pt
*.pth
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.h5

# Dated run-output directories. These are written into the repo working tree
# because $SCRATCH/spin_gnn IS the tree, so each new one needs ignoring.
# Anchored to the root: without the leading slash these also matched
# notebooks/sudoku_*_2026-*/, whose figures a results notebook has to carry.
/sudoku_*_2026-*/
/sudoku_sae_*/
/sudoku_circuits_*/
notebooks/**/page*.png
notebooks/_tokpages/
_smoke_*/
# $HOME/spin_gnn symlinks to $SCRATCH/spin_gnn, so "put it on $SCRATCH" puts it
# in the repo root. Layout smoke tests render pages from fabricated summaries
# and must never be mistaken for a run.
_*_smoke/
# ...and their numbered reruns, plus the one-off eval CSVs the smoke tests emit.
_*_smoke[0-9]*/
_*_smoke[0-9]*.csv
_*_smoke.csv
# Deck build output: $SCRATCH/spin_gnn IS this working tree, so the deck
# scripts' PNG-per-page output lands here. Only the PDF is kept, committed by
# hand under notebooks/<topic>/slides.pdf the way every earlier deck was.
decks/
notebooks/stagen_2026-11-10_DRY_PARTIAL/
# Draft deck renders, named <topic>_draft_<jobid>: a page-per-PNG dump plus a
# PDF, ~2 MB each, superseded the moment the kept copy lands under notebooks/.
# Drafts are supposed to go to $SCRATCH, which IS this tree, hence the rule.
/*_draft_[0-9]*/
/s4_refit_check_[0-9]*/
# Smoke tests also emit single JSON summaries, not just directories.
_smoke_*.json
_*_smoke.json
# Web-deck drafts rendered before the deck goes to ~/slides. Same reasoning:
# the builder under notebooks/ is the kept artefact, the render is not.
/deckdraft/
